* Idealised single-pole op-amp (portable: LTspice + ngspice)
* A0 = DC open-loop gain, GBW = gain-bandwidth product (Hz)
* No noise, no slew limit, no output swing limit, zero offset.
.subckt OPAMP_IDEAL inp inn out A0=1e6 GBW=10e6
G1 0 x inp inn 1
R1 x 0 {A0}
C1 x 0 {1/(6.283185307*GBW)}
E1 out 0 x 0 1
.ends OPAMP_IDEAL
